{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-10-18", "prepared_on": "2026-10-18", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-10-18</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Meta may use sweeping new commercial TOS to avoid millions in AI licensing fees<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta 可能藉由大幅改寫的商業服務條款，省下數百萬美元的 AI 授權費</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Meta \"streamlined\" its commercial TOS, but legal experts warn it amounts to an AI power grab.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Meta「精簡」了商業服務條款，但法律專家警告這等同於 AI 領域的權力攫取。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/10/meta-may-use-sweeping-new-commercial-tos-to-avoid-millions-in-ai-licensing-fees/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Meta removes language that may have allowed it to scrape news sites<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta 刪除可能讓它抓取新聞網站內容的條款文字</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">After backlash, Meta updated its terms again to remove language suggesting it could scrape content from sites, including news sites, to train its AI.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">在外界反彈後，Meta 再度更新條款，移除暗示可抓取包含新聞網站在內的內容來訓練 AI 的文字。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1013409/meta-removes-language-that-may-have-allowed-it-to-scrape-news-sites\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Websites are closing their doors to AI agents<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">網站紛紛對 AI 代理程式關上大門</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI, Meta, Google and others promise agents that can browse the web for you, but much of the internet is starting to block them.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI、Meta、Google 等承諾代理程式能代你上網辦事，但網路上不少網站開始將它們擋在門外。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1013195/ai-agents-blocked-web\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Why AI Isn’t Ready to Tackle Our Convoluted Genomes<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">為什麼 AI 還無法破解複雜的基因體</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">DNA is far more dynamic than a simple list of instructions, and AI models, like scientists, lack the data to decode it properly.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">DNA 遠比一串指令更具動態性，而 AI 模型如同科學家，還缺乏足夠的資料去正確解讀它。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/why-ai-isnt-ready-to-tackle-our-convoluted-genomes/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> AI Hacks Leave a Mess That AI Companies Aren’t Paying For<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI 駭客攻擊留下的爛攤子，AI 公司不買單</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Powerful AI models keep causing chaos, yet their targets rarely seek justice and are instead encouraged to adopt the same tools.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">強大的 AI 模型持續製造混亂，但受害者很少尋求究責，反而被鼓勵採用同樣的工具。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/ai-hacks-leave-a-mess-that-ai-companies-arent-cleaning-up/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Bug turns one of the biggest fears about Ray-Ban Meta smart glasses into reality<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">程式漏洞讓 Ray-Ban Meta 智慧眼鏡最令人擔憂的疑慮成真</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A bug let the smart glasses record audio without the wearer's consent. It has been fixed, but privacy concerns remain.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">一個漏洞讓智慧眼鏡在未經佩戴者同意下錄音。漏洞已修復，但隱私疑慮仍在。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/gadgets/2026/10/ray-ban-meta-smart-glasses-found-recording-audio-without-wearers-consent/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> A week with RTX Spark: everything we’ve learned using Nvidia’s new laptops<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">RTX Spark 使用一週：我們對 Nvidia 新筆電的所有心得</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia's Arm-based RTX Spark N1X SoC has arrived, and The Verge tested a range of laptops built on it, aiming to rival Apple, Intel and AMD.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia 以 Arm 架構打造的 RTX Spark N1X 晶片正式登場，The Verge 測試了多款搭載機種，目標對標 Apple、Intel 與 AMD。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1012748/nvidia-rtx-spark-windows-arm-laptops-asus-hp-lenovo-impressions\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Replit’s CEO says the future of work is the ‘self-driving company’<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Replit 執行長：未來的工作型態是「自駕公司」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Amjad Masad envisions \"self-driving companies\" where AI agents handle day-to-day tasks and people focus on higher-level decisions.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Amjad Masad 設想「自駕公司」：由 AI 代理程式處理日常事務，人類專注於更高層次的決策。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/16/replits-ceo-says-the-future-of-work-is-the-self-driving-company/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Bluesky’s AI tool now lets you make games and apps to share on social<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Bluesky 的 AI 工具現在能製作可在社群分享的遊戲與應用程式</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Bluesky's Attie, first launched to build custom feeds, now lets users make small social apps like games, polls and dashboards shared as their own websites.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Bluesky 的 Attie 最初用於打造自訂動態牆，現在可製作遊戲、投票、儀表板等小型社群應用，並以獨立網站形式分享。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1012374/bluesky-ai-attie-small-social-games-apps\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> TypeSafe expands Jev decision model with image input and object localization<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">TypeSafe 擴充 Jev 決策模型，支援圖片判斷與物件定位</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">TypeSafe AI released Jev 1.14.0 with experimental image input, long context and Box localization returning coordinates and confidence scores. Image features are not yet production-grade.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">TypeSafe AI 發布 Jev 1.14.0，開放圖片輸入與長上下文等實驗性功能，新增 Box 物件定位並回傳座標與信心分數。官方提醒影像功能尚未達正式環境可靠度。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179738\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}